{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker","doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/Snowplow"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@objc(cs)SPSnowplow(cm)setupWithRemoteConfiguration:defaultConfiguration:defaultConfigurationVersion:onSuccess:","title":"setup(remoteConfiguration:defaultConfiguration:defaultConfigurationVersion:onSuccess:)","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Type Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setup"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"remoteConfiguration"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@objc(cs)SPRemoteConfiguration","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"RemoteConfiguration"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"defaultConfiguration"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@objc(cs)SPConfigurationBundle","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ConfigurationBundle"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"defaultConfigurationVersion"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"onSuccess"},{"kind":"text","text":": (["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?, "},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@E@SPConfigurationState","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ConfigurationState"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"modules":[{"name":"SnowplowTracker"}],"symbolKind":"method"},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/Snowplow\/setup(remoteConfiguration:defaultConfiguration:defaultConfigurationVersion:onSuccess:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Setup a single or a set of tracker instances which will be used inside the app to track events."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/snowplowtracker\/snowplow\/setup(remoteconfiguration:defaultconfiguration:defaultconfigurationversion:onsuccess:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@objc"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setup"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"remoteConfiguration"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/RemoteConfiguration","text":"RemoteConfiguration","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@objc(cs)SPRemoteConfiguration"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"defaultConfiguration"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"defaultBundles"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/ConfigurationBundle","text":"ConfigurationBundle","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@objc(cs)SPConfigurationBundle"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"defaultConfigurationVersion"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"defaultBundleVersion"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":" = NSInteger.min, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"onSuccess"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"@escaping"},{"kind":"text","text":" (["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?, "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/ConfigurationState","text":"ConfigurationState","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@E@SPConfigurationState"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Void","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"remoteConfiguration","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The remote configuration used to indicate where to download the configuration from.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"defaultBundles","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The default configuration passed by default in case there isn’t a cached version and it’s able to download a new one.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"defaultBundleVersion","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Version of the default configuration that will be used to compare with the fetched remote config to decide whether to replace it.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"onSuccess","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The callback called when a configuration (cached or downloaded) is set.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It passes two arguments: list of the namespaces associated to the created trackers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and the state of the configuration – whether it was retrieved from cache or fetched over the network.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The app can run multiple tracker instances which will be identified by string ","type":"text"},{"code":"namespaces","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The trackers configuration is automatically download from the endpoint indicated in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"RemoteConfiguration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"passed as argument. For more details see ","type":"text"},{"code":"RemoteConfiguration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The method is asynchronous and you can receive the list of the created trackers in the callbacks once the trackers are created."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The callback can be called multiple times in case a cached configuration is ready and later a fetched configuration is available."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can also pass as argument a default configuration in case there isn’t a cached configuration and it’s not able to download"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a new one. The downloaded configuration updates the cached one only if the configuration version is greater than the cached one."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Otherwise the cached one is kept and the callback is not called."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: The EventStore will persist all the events that have been tracked but not yet sent."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Those events are attached to the namespace."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If the tracker is removed or the app relaunched with a different namespace, those events can’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be sent to the collector and they remain in a zombie state inside the EventStore."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To remove all the zombie events you can call an internal method "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"removeUnsentEventsExceptForNamespaces"},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SPSQLEventStore"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which will delete all the EventStores instanced with namespaces not listed in the passed list."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://SnowplowTracker/documentation/SnowplowTracker/RemoteConfiguration":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/snowplowtracker\/remoteconfiguration","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/RemoteConfiguration","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Represents the configuration for fetching configurations from a remote source."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For details on the correct format of a remote configuration see the official documentation."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RemoteConfiguration"}],"title":"RemoteConfiguration","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RemoteConfiguration"}]},"doc://SnowplowTracker/documentation/SnowplowTracker/ConfigurationBundle":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ConfigurationBundle","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/ConfigurationBundle","url":"\/documentation\/snowplowtracker\/configurationbundle","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConfigurationBundle","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"ConfigurationBundle","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This class represents the default configuration applied in place of the remote configuration."}]},"doc://SnowplowTracker/documentation/SnowplowTracker/Snowplow":{"url":"\/documentation\/snowplowtracker\/snowplow","title":"Snowplow","role":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Snowplow"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Entry point to instance a new Snowplow tracker."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Snowplow"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/Snowplow"},"doc://SnowplowTracker/documentation/SnowplowTracker/Snowpl